'''Mega Absol ex''' (Japanese: '''メガアブソルex''' ''Mega Absol ex'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

